===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|en|/ˈflʊɚˌaɪt/|/ˈflɔɹˌaɪt/|a=US}}

===Noun===
{{en-noun|~}}

# {{senseid|en|Q102151}} {{lb|en|mineral}} A widely occurring [[mineral]] comprising [[calcium fluoride]] plus or minus impurities, of various [[colour]]s, used as a [[flux]] in [[steelmaking]], and in the [[manufacture]] of [[glass]], [[enamel]]s and [[hydrofluoric acid]].
#: {{syn|en|fluor<id:Q102151>|fluorspar<id:Q102151>|}}
#: {{hyper|en|mineral#Noun|<|material#Noun}}
#: {{hypo|en|blue John#Noun|Derbyshire spar#Noun}}
#: {{nearsyn|en|calcium fluoride#Noun}}
#: {{ux|en|'''Fluorite''' is an important natural resource of Thailand.}}

